flowchart TD
    A["🏠 Overview Tab<br/>• Cross-departmental KPIs<br/>• Company-wide metrics<br/>• Alert panels<br/>• Quick actions"] 
    
    B["📊 Department Tab<br/>• Performance Section (KPIs)<br/>• Marketing Processes Section<br/>• Active Tasks Section<br/>• AI Workers Section"]
    
    C["⚙️ Process Builder Modal<br/>• Process name & description<br/>• Persona selector<br/>• Tools selection<br/>• Template options<br/>• Save & deploy"]
    
    D["🛠️ Tool Marketplace Modal<br/>• Browse tool categories<br/>• Tool cards with descriptions<br/>• Install/Connect tools<br/>• Search & filter<br/>• My Tools tab"]
    
    E["🔧 Tool Configuration Modal<br/>• API credentials setup<br/>• Test connections<br/>• Permission settings<br/>• Usage limits<br/>• Save configuration"]
    
    F["📋 Task Assignment Modal<br/>• Select process blueprint<br/>• Choose AI worker<br/>• Set parameters & priority<br/>• Resource allocation<br/>• Create task instance"]
    
    G["📝 Task Details Modal<br/>• Task overview & progress<br/>• Execution logs<br/>• Tool usage tracking<br/>• Results & outputs<br/>• Action controls"]
    
    H["📚 Process Templates Gallery<br/>• Pre-built templates<br/>• Department-specific<br/>• Preview & customize<br/>• Start from template"]
    
    I["🤖 Worker Management Modal<br/>• Worker performance analytics<br/>• Task assignment<br/>• Worker chat interface<br/>• Workload distribution<br/>• Worker controls"]
    
    J["📁 File Upload Dialog<br/>• Import process files<br/>• Drag & drop interface<br/>• File validation<br/>• Import confirmation"]
    
    K["💬 Worker Chat Modal<br/>• Direct communication<br/>• Task instructions<br/>• Status updates<br/>• Performance feedback"]

    %% Main navigation
    A -->|"Click department tab"| B
    B -->|"Switch departments"| B
    
    %% Process management flows
    B -->|"Create New Process"| C
    B -->|"Browse Templates"| H
    B -->|"Import Process"| J
    H -->|"Customize template"| C
    B -->|"Edit existing process"| C
    C -->|"Save & close"| B
    J -->|"Import complete"| B
    
    %% Tool management flows
    B -->|"Browse Tools"| D
    D -->|"Install/Connect tool"| E
    E -->|"Configuration complete"| D
    D -->|"Close marketplace"| B
    
    %% Task management flows
    B -->|"Create Task from process"| F
    F -->|"Task created"| B
    B -->|"View task details"| G
    B -->|"Pause/Resume task"| G
    B -->|"Terminate task"| G
    G -->|"Close details"| B
    
    %% AI Workers management flows
    B -->|"View worker analytics"| I
    B -->|"Assign task to worker"| F
    B -->|"Chat with worker"| K
    B -->|"Bulk assign tasks"| F
    I -->|"Assign task"| F
    I -->|"Chat with worker"| K
    I -->|"Close worker panel"| B
    K -->|"Close chat"| B
    K -->|"Close chat"| I
    
    %% Tool integration in process builder
    C -->|"Add new tool"| D
    D -->|"Tool selected"| C
    
    %% Quick actions from overview
    A -->|"Quick: Create Process"| C
    A -->|"Quick: Assign Task"| F
    A -->|"Quick: View Department"| B
    
    %% Bulk operations
    B -->|"Resume Selected Tasks"| G
    B -->|"Pause Selected Tasks"| G
    B -->|"Terminate Selected Tasks"| G
    B -->|"Schedule Maintenance"| I
    B -->|"Generate Performance Report"| I
    
    %% Return to overview
    B -->|"Home/Overview"| A
    C -->|"Cancel"| A
    F -->|"Cancel"| A
    G -->|"Return to overview"| A
    I -->|"Return to overview"| A

    %% Styling
    classDef mainScreen fill:#e1f5fe
    classDef modal fill:#fff3e0
    classDef template fill:#f3e5f5
    classDef worker fill:#e8f5e8
    classDef utility fill:#fce4ec
    
    class A,B mainScreen
    class C,D,E,F,G modal
    class H template
    class I,K worker
    class J utility